{"cantica":"paradiso","cantoNumber":11,"title":"Canto XI","totalDuration":330.159,"segments":[{"id":1,"speaker":"narrator","text":"O blind obsession of mortal minds!\nHow flawed the reasoning that sends you\nspiraling downward on desperate wings!\nOne chased after law, another after clever sayings,\none pursued the priesthood, another sought to rule\nthrough force or cunning arguments.\nOne lost himself in theft, another in politics,\none exhausted himself in pleasures of the flesh,\nwhile another surrendered to lazy comfort.\nBut I—freed from all these things—\nwas received with Beatrice here in the heavens\nwith such overwhelming glory!\nWhen each soul had returned to its place\nwithin the circle where it was before,\nit stood like a candle in its holder.\nAnd from within that radiance\nwhich had first spoken to me,\nI heard a voice begin, smiling\nas it grew more luminous:","startTime":0,"endTime":48.159,"words":[{"word":"O","start":0.32,"end":0.72},{"word":"blind","start":0.72,"end":1.4},{"word":"obsession","start":1.4,"end":2},{"word":"of","start":2,"end":2.16},{"word":"mortal","start":2.16,"end":2.64},{"word":"minds!","start":2.64,"end":3.6},{"word":"How","start":3.6,"end":3.92},{"word":"flawed","start":3.92,"end":4.44},{"word":"the","start":4.44,"end":4.56},{"word":"reasoning","start":4.56,"end":5.12},{"word":"that","start":5.12,"end":5.24},{"word":"sends","start":5.24,"end":5.56},{"word":"you","start":5.56,"end":5.88},{"word":"spiraling","start":5.88,"end":6.4},{"word":"downward","start":6.4,"end":6.92},{"word":"on","start":6.92,"end":7.12},{"word":"desperate","start":7.12,"end":7.6},{"word":"wings!","start":7.6,"end":8.72},{"word":"One","start":8.72,"end":9.04},{"word":"chased","start":9.04,"end":9.36},{"word":"after","start":9.36,"end":9.68},{"word":"law,","start":9.68,"end":10.32},{"word":"another","start":10.32,"end":10.92},{"word":"after","start":10.92,"end":11.12},{"word":"clever","start":11.12,"end":11.52},{"word":"sayings,","start":11.52,"end":12.4},